Subject: [PATCH 294/333] [ae-patch] Tell a lead-picks lead to ask the preset
 advisor first

When the Decision-1 advisor is available for the session owner, the lead-picks roles
block gains one line telling the lead to call advise_preset with a neutral summary
before it picks. The full preset block stays. The availability check lives in
ae_omni_policies.decision_advisor and is optional, like role_prefs.
---
 omnigent/inner/ae_roles.py   | 23 +++++++++++++++
 tests/inner/test_ae_roles.py | 54 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 77 insertions(+)

